ng hair conditioner on your armpits when you are shaving. Not too much. This is all you need. And this actually protects your skin and causes way less friction, avoiding from making dark stain spots. And let me tell you, it shaves off 10 times better and also moisturizes your skin. Next, exfoliate. You want to exfoliate gently. Do not go like this as if a bear is scratching its back on a tree. Next, for whitening your armpits and moisturizing, take Vaseline. And if you have a vitamin C brightening cream in your house, I use mine from Arendtia. If you do not have this kind of option, take a vitamin C pill, Vaseline, vitamin C cream, or Vaseline, vitamin C pill. Squeeze it. Mix. Mix. This option might be a little bit strong for some people. This option will be the best for sensitive skinned people. Take the concoction, put it on your armpits, and really massage it through. Vitamin C is very important for brightening your under armpits. Lastly, every morning use a sun serum on your armpits so that we can protect it from going dark. Repeat this step for two or three times a week for a month, you will definitely see results. Thank me later and follow Amyism.","transcriptLanguage":"en","transcriptChunks":[{"startSeconds":0.292,"endSeconds":5.372,"text":"armpits. You deserve a smooth like butter armpits. It's not hard. It's very easy. I'm"},{"startSeconds":5.372,"endSeconds":10.672,"text":"going to show you step by step. So stay tuned. First, get a warm towel and put it on your"},{"startSeconds":10.672,"endSeconds":15.332,"text":"armpits. Fun fact, your armpits have a lot of stress, probably more than you. Yeah, I"},{"startSeconds":15.332,"endSeconds":21.012,"text":"know. So you need to relax all the muscles in your armpits and massage as well and drain"},{"startSeconds":21.012,"endSeconds":26.252,"text":"all the toxins. Secondly, this is a tip that you will thank me later. Instead of using shaving"},{"startSeconds":26.252,"endSeconds":31.752,"text":"foam, try using hair c